flowchart LR
    Profile[CandidateProfile + durable preferences] --> Planner[Research planning prompt v2]
    Planner --> Guard{Portable query shape valid?}
    Guard -->|No, first response| Planner
    Guard -->|No, second response| Stop[Sanitized planning error]
    Guard -->|Yes| Port{{SupervisorSearchPort}}

    Port --> You[You.com title + description + bounded snippets]
    Port --> Tavily[Tavily title + bounded content]
    You --> Extract{Plausible person + academic context + institution?}
    Tavily --> Extract
    Extract -->|No| Exclude[Exclude result]
    Extract -->|Yes| Dedupe[Deterministic deduplication]
    Dedupe --> Prospective[Prospective Supervisor + exact provenance]

    Port --> Attempt[Typed SearchAttempt aggregates]
    Extract --> Attempt
    Attempt --> Policy{Bounded DiscoveryPolicy}
    Policy --> Route[Continue, retry, fallback, or stop]
    Attempt --> UI[Privacy-safe Streamlit projection]
    Attempt --> Trace[Empty-payload LangSmith tool span]

    classDef external fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#245a9b;
    class You,Tavily,Trace external;
